  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org/post/3miawjaazyc24","mainEntity":{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org/post/3miawjaazyc24","identifier":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3miawjaazyc24","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dustin Moskovitz","alternateName":"@moskov.goodventures.org","identifier":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org","reviewedBy":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Bluesky","alternateName":"@bsky.app","identifier":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/bsky.app"}]},"text":"Per the other thread all Anthropic holdings are in the foundation, dedicated to charity.\n\nThe “AI is a scam” narrative was annoying last year. It is itself the scam among the people who continue to peddle it. Great changes are coming and people need to stop burying their heads in the sand.","datePublished":"2026-03-30T05:28:20.553Z","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":3},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":3},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/ShareAction","userInteractionCount":0}],"commentCount":3,"comment":[{"@type":"Comment","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/icanfly42.bsky.social/post/3mibotcj7hk2k","identifier":"at://did:plc:zqytu7uu6wrnrduynshkoxni/app.bsky.feed.post/3mibotcj7hk2k","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Friendly Neighborhood Transsexual","alternateName":"@icanfly42.bsky.social","identifier":"did:plc:zqytu7uu6wrnrduynshkoxni","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/icanfly42.bsky.social"},"text":"I don't care what your opinion of Ed is, but you know that asserting that the thing people don't like is going to change the world whether they like it or not does not convince people to like the thing, right?","datePublished":"2026-03-30T12:43:27.362Z"},{"@type":"Comment","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org/post/3miawnipfmk24","identifier":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3miawnipfmk24","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dustin Moskovitz","alternateName":"@moskov.goodventures.org","identifier":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org"},"text":"I politely engaged Ed a dozen times with no acknowledgement and now I am simply recognizing him as a charlatan. I’m being direct so that people see it clearly instead of playing word games like he does.","datePublished":"2026-03-30T05:30:43.949Z"},{"@type":"Comment","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/txo.bsky.social/post/3miawnuurlc2w","identifier":"at://did:plc:6mkkeo42btv25yokamfue527/app.bsky.feed.post/3miawnuurlc2w","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gnome de guerre","alternateName":"@txo.bsky.social","identifier":"did:plc:6mkkeo42btv25yokamfue527","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/txo.bsky.social"},"text":"Dustin - can you share your brief pov re some of the positives that are coming? (sincere, neutral q)","datePublished":"2026-03-30T05:30:57.157Z"}],"isPartOf":"https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3miabmrzhh22m"}}</script>
  
