  <p id="bsky_post_text">Per the other thread all Anthropic holdings are in the foundation, dedicated to charity.

The “AI is a scam” narrative was annoying last year. It is itself the scam among the people who continue to peddle it. Great changes are coming and people need to stop burying their heads in the sand.</p>
